# Founding Engineer  
**The Campus App**

## About The Campus App

The Campus App is building the digital home for university life. We are creating an ecosystem that brings together students, societies, wellbeing, careers, and community in one place.

The product is already live, used by real students, and growing through university partnerships.

We are now looking for a Founding Engineer to join us at a defining moment and help shape the future of the platform from the inside.

## The Opportunity

This is a true founding-stage role.

You will work closely with the founder and take ownership of technical decisions, product direction, and execution. The focus is on turning an already live product into a scalable system that can support students across multiple universities.

From day one, you will have real responsibility and influence. As the company grows, this role is designed to grow into CTO-level responsibility, including ownership over architecture, engineering culture, and long-term technical strategy.

## This role is a good fit if you

- Care about deeply understanding problems, users, and context before jumping to solutions  
- Can translate business goals and real-world constraints into clear technical decisions  
- Are comfortable working in ambiguity and figuring things out as you go  
- Balance speed, quality, and long-term thinking when making trade-offs  
- Use AI as a practical tool to move faster while relying on strong engineering judgement  
- Have strong opinions, take initiative, and are open to changing your mind  
- Are interested in the student or university ecosystem, or excited to learn it  
- Want meaningful ownership, responsibility, and long-term impact  

## Career growth

You will begin by owning technical execution and core product decisions.

As the platform scales, you will naturally take on responsibility across architecture, strategy, and team leadership. Over time, this role evolves into leading the engineering function and shaping how technology supports the company’s long-term vision.

This is a role designed to compound with the company.

## Why join The Campus App

- Founding-level ownership from day one  
- Meaningful equity and long-term upside  
- Direct influence over product, architecture, and engineering culture  
- Opportunity to build a product used daily by students across universities  
- Work closely with a founder who is product-focused and mission-driven  
- Small, ambitious team that values trust, autonomy, and building together  

Community matters to us, internally and externally. We are building something people genuinely want to be part of.

## A note on AI

We value engineers who think deeply before building.

AI is a powerful accelerator, but great products are built on judgement, context, and domain understanding. We are looking for someone who uses AI thoughtfully to move faster, not to skip the thinking.

